{"pageid":3326,"title":"Corrupt Deadwood","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Corrupt Deadwood</span>","revid":18795,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"notice\" style=\"border-radius:15px; border:3px solid #3C3C3C; background:#505050; font-size:90%; width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><p style=\"margin-bottom:.3em\"><span style=\"font-size:125%; font-weight:semi-bold\">This page is a <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Stubs\" title=\"Category:Stubs\">stub</a>!</span><br />\n<span>You can help the Oaklands Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Corrupt_Deadwood?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<pre>\"A chopped up tree. Can be turned into smooth planks with a handsaw or a sander! It can also be put into a schematic.\"\n</pre>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Corrupted Deadwood</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ee/Corrupt_deadwood.png/revision/latest?cb=20241005100036\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Corrupt deadwood\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ee/Corrupt_deadwood.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241005100036\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ee/Corrupt_deadwood.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20241005100036 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/ee/Corrupt_deadwood.png/revision/latest?cb=20241005100036 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Corrupt deadwood\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Corrupt_deadwood.png\" data-image-name=\"Corrupt deadwood.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">Logged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">Sanded</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">Planked</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">?/Stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">?/Stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">?/Stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Corrupted Deadwood</b> is a tree introduced during the <b>2024 Halloween Event.</b> Unlike the rest of the event, however, the Corrupted Deadwood and the other corrupted items were planned to be a permanent addition to the game.\n</p><p>It can be obtained by exposing <a href=\"/wiki/Deadwood\" title=\"Deadwood\">Deadwood</a> to a spore made by <a href=\"/wiki/Mysterious_Mushrooms\" title=\"Mysterious Mushrooms\">Mysterious Mushrooms</a> (Formally found in the Desert on the <a href=\"/wiki/Ferwater_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ferwater Island\">Ferwater Island</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Corrupt_Biome\" title=\"Corrupt Biome\">Corrupt Biome</a>). It is identified by its small size, the lack of any leaves, and its purple corrupted color. Unlike other trees in the game, its sanded texture is different from the normal wood. It has a unique pattern of lighter-colored waves of purple.\n</p><p>Like any other material in the game, you can use logs, sanded, and planked Corrupted Deadwood to complete schematics.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>It is a little larger than a regular Deadwood tree.</li>\n<li>The Corrupted Deadwood was introduced during the 1.68.0 \"The Spooky Month\" update alongside The Corrupted, Corrupted Acacia Tree, Corrupted Cactus,  Corrupted Tumbleweed, and Corrupted Limestone.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><